[I] XDG Desktop Portal backend component of the oo7 keyring project

[T] oo7 is a Rust implementation of the freedesktop.org Secret Service API.
[T] This package builds the `portal` sub-crate of the oo7 workspace, the
[T] org.freedesktop.portal.Secret backend giving sandboxed (Flatpak)
[T] applications access to secrets.

[U] https://github.com/linux-credentials/oo7

[A] Bilal Elmoussaoui
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/security

[L] MIT
